{"server":"tw","storyId":"act19side_level_act19side_02_end","groupId":"act19side","stageId":"act19side_02","title":"拓荒者小屋","storyCode":"DV-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"2a3cf1bee5a133a9585515fc2d922763b9ffe481bd7dfabce54d811f48e0b877","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g8_alley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得承認，我沒想到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我也沒想到。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"直到我看到塞雷婭動手......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們放心，我也並不想再進一次監獄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那這現場處理起來就容易多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，我是個機械師，拆解一具機械花不了多少時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......你是怎麼知道它裡面是空心的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和這批動力甲交手過幾次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也被它們追殺過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"它們不是塞雷婭的對手。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"反過來還差不多......","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然它們出現在這裡，那說明有人並不希望我們追查繆爾賽思的下落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個人會是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有多種可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我與繆爾賽思聯絡不多，只知道她在失蹤前正在參與某項由萊茵生命主導的秘密實驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"考慮到我早已離開萊茵，她向我透露上述資訊已經違反保密協定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊茵防衛科會出動尖端武器幹掉洩密的員工嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，這也是保密條款。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島真是良心企業，是吧，Dr.{@nickname}？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"羅德島不僅僅是一家企業。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"要不然也招募不到你們。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繆爾賽思不是萊茵生命的普通員工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能將她逼至絕境，對方的專業程度不亞於我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種型號的動力甲大約在半年前出現在了某些雇傭兵團體中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它所使用的防禦材料與裝配武器都並不出彩，整體性能與五年前的軍方量產動力甲相當。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有一點很特殊——它對使用者沒有要求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有要求......是多低的要求？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任何生理指標能維持一般運動狀態的個體都能滿足要求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以，Mechanist先生可以，博士也可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那是夠低的了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我還真想試試。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不會喜歡這感覺的，博士，我向你保證。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前能穿動力甲的都是精銳士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能控制那大玩意兒在戰場上長時間搏殺，而不是蹦幾下就淹死在自己的嘔吐物裡——真不是未經訓練的人能做到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你問問堅雷就知道了。她說她當時只穿過一次就滿腦子想著退役。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信幾年時間足夠讓那幫人把技術反覆運算幾十次了，而且雇傭兵裡本來就不乏退役士兵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但誰都能穿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這搞不好是能顛覆戰爭方式的發明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前類似的動力甲流到外面的數量極少，可見這項技術還只是在原型階段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我正在追查它的來源。和其他許多實驗性武器一樣，要獲得線索並不容易。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"哥倫比亞的雇傭兵這麼有錢？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這動力甲技術非常先進吧？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇傭兵們未必是客戶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下這批訂單的人眼裡，雇傭兵跟這新型動力甲沒有區別——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——都只是實驗品而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"移動城市投影的邊緣往往也是文明法則是否適用的分界線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些活躍在荒地上的雇傭兵，和那些拓荒者一樣，都是最方便的實驗對象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使實驗失敗了，他們被消耗掉了，也很少有人去追究他們的下落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且很快，又會有下一批實驗品被補充進來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒人反對？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反對缺乏意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇傭兵們很清楚，手裡拿著的新型武器可能會爆炸，但也可能比對手的武器威力更強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在法律上，這些你情我願的交易都是接近合規的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mechanist先生，你有什麼新發現嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對勁......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從剛剛開始，我就覺得哪裡不對勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這動力甲裡面沒有人——為什麼我沒有一眼看出來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是有雇傭兵在遠處使用無線電遙控，還是設置了自動程式，都會有明顯的模式規律。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"就像可露希爾的無人機。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"就像Lancet-2和Castle-3。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顯然，它們都不會這麼靈活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在羅德島研發的新一代武器當中，自動化程度最高的也遠遠無法騙過我的眼睛——你讓我相信那幫被軍隊豢養的蠢笨機械師能做到？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切斷動力甲的“神經中樞”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些導管裡淌出來了......銀色的液體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼物質？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許它就是上述問題的答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g1_outdoorbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逃出來了......嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......我......我很久沒跑這麼快了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那到底是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"形狀奇特的物體","speakerId":"avg_npc_533_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它追出來了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趴下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是剛才那個......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少有十多個，甚至更多，它們圍住了居住區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們......變多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"變多了？你見過這種物體？你說清楚些！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......烏比卡博士，該說清楚的不是你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在胡言亂語什麼......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"躲開——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——這東西移動得太快了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦被撞到的話後果不堪設想——我們是不是該回到室內？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最好不要這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......我們待的那間屋子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在看不見的巨大力量的衝擊下，拓荒者的小屋劇烈地搖晃著，並不算太牢靠的門窗紛紛開裂。\n幾乎在同一時間，原本盤旋在半空的奇特物體都湧向了那間屋子。\n銀色的液體飛快地滲進門窗的裂痕中，就如同聞到血腥味的微小生物前赴後繼地鑽進獵物的傷口裡。\n而下一瞬間，令在場的科學家們都無法理解的事情發生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那間屋子是不是......消失了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是消失了——它被分解了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"分解？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到空中那些......漂浮著的東西了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說，它們原本是屋子的一部分？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們恐怕是屋子的全部。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"話音剛落，靜止在空中的碎片紛紛落了下來。\n巨響、煙塵、滿地殘渣，就像被強行停止的時鐘重新轉動，本該存在的一切也都回來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我是不是中了某種精神控制類的源石技藝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否則的話，我看到的一切怎麼會都......不符合我所熟知的物理規則。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是那些銀色液體幹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們......分散成了無數細小的個體，拆解並帶走了原本屬於那間屋子的一部分......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後它們重新聚合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像有幾十隻看不見的......手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士們，你們彷彿在談論某種幽靈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，白面鴞——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完了，剛剛喬伊絲還在屋子裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她該不會也被......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邁爾！你也逃出來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"領、領隊......我把......摩爾醫生......帶出來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬伊絲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還、還好......她沒事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他的傷勢不算重，但是體力接近透支，急需休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不能留在這個地方。整個拓荒者居住區都不再安全。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g2_edgeofbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你都看到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道您指的是什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別跟我裝傻，剛才那震動你沒感覺到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些飄來飄去的是什麼新型號的無人機嗎？你們萊茵自己研發的？該死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能向您保證，我們沒有違反您的命令對基地採取任何行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你老大叫什麼來著？斐爾迪南是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斐爾迪南·克魯尼先生是萊茵生命能量科的主任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我才不管你們公司是什麼架構。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我通訊器，我要跟他通話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斐爾迪南主任非常忙碌......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麻煩你給他發一條消息——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"問問他知不知道自己有多混蛋！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g9_headquarter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主任，有您的消息，是從基地監控站發過來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，您的兒子似乎也有事找您，是否接通通訊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老規矩，跟他說我很忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，把埃琳娜最近一次報告的內容轉到我的終端上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，斐爾迪南主任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過很多次了吧？別再叫我主任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！對不起，斐爾迪南先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說到埃琳娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和她關係還不錯吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"替我想一想，她會喜歡什麼樣的禮物？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g2_edgeofbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......奧利維亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我忙著治療受傷的拓荒者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有沒有受傷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......還好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有你的外勤經驗，但顧好自己還是做得到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......我們難道不應該趕緊撤離嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在基地亂作一團......拓荒者自顧不暇。這是我們逃出去的好時機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主任肯定收到了消息，他會派人來接我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我們和防衛科的同事會合，就一定能解除基地的威脅，救出多蘿西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許你是對的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我做不到。我沒法拋下他們不管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到了......他們剛剛同樣沒有拋下喬伊絲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默醫生，這裡又有幾個人受傷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無人機——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再這樣下去，我們撐不了多久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有攻擊手段我都試過了，沒用。那些怪物既不會受傷，也無法被破壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們甚至......無處躲藏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"領隊，你跟她們說這些做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們說不定正高興著呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們頭頂上這些就是警察和大公司派出來的神秘武器！他們想要我們永遠走不出這個基地——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩姆，先別說這些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，我......我有一個猜想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格雷伊......你有什麼辦法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別急，你跑太快了，小心弄傷你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我觀察到，那些物體好像會追著光和人聲走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們看......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......它們追著你的法術光球飛遠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......只是暫時的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的法術還做不到騙它們更久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你盡力了，而且做得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趨光性嗎......你提供了一個有趣的思路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格雷伊，你能幫助疏散附近的拓荒者嗎？他們信任你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請讓他們躲在暗處不要出聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我知道該怎麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"類似的工作我跟著前輩們做過很多次了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默醫生，您和埃琳娜小姐也請小心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弄出點動靜來。越大越好，起碼要掩蓋掉其他人的腳步聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩姆，再叫五六個人過來，拿上最能製造噪音的工具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真準備聽他們的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有更好的主意嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你說了算，頭兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把所有銀色物體都引到我們這邊來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們來充當誘餌——然後呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先儘量拖延......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然後來實驗區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這聲音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多蘿西？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，是我，埃琳娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我改裝了一下實驗室的擴音設備——希望沒嚇到你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我很安全，請不必為我擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"實驗區的建築更結實，也能為大家抵擋威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位——無論是拓荒隊的朋友們，還是萊茵的同事們，實驗區的大門將為你們打開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
